        <h2 class="font-semibold text-2xl text-gray-900">How we use information</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 pl-6 space-y-2 list-disc">
          <li>To provide and improve the service.</li>
          <li>To moderate reviews and enforce our content policies.</li>
          <li>To send you transactional emails (account confirmations, replies, billing).</li>
